From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oop23 <ilidans01yt@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 04:40:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Player: Stop button, swipe to seek, brightness never
 remembered

- Stop in the player bar (back used to be the only way out).
- Horizontal swipe seeks, Kodi/MX style: the screen width is 90 s, the
  target time is previewed while the finger moves and applied on release.
- Brightness gestures only override this window for this video: the
  system brightness is never touched and nothing is remembered, so an
  accidental swipe does not stick to the next video.
---
